{{Purpose and Retention Period:}} 

The following wording can be used to point it out to the user:

For information on how we process relevant personal data, we refer you to our Privacy Policy at [https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/5aYfdVhjTc904Anil6j5V6/Bolt Food Privacy Policy for courier and eaters (EST).pdf|https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/5aYfdVhjTc904Anil6j5V6/Bolt%20Food%20Privacy%20Policy%20for%20courier%20and%20eaters%20(EST).pdf] which includes further information about:

* The categories of personal data we process;
