* The criteria we use to determine how long to retain personal data;
* The sources of personal data received from other parties;
* The existence and envisaged consequences of any automated decision-making/profiling of personal data; and
* Details of any transfer of your personal data to third countries or international organisations and the safeguards used for any such transfers.

{{Sharing with Couriers and Venues:}} 

Bolt and the Courier are independent data controllers in relation to personal data of Clients. Bolt collects personal data of the Client and shares _“the first name and first letter of the last name of the Client, geographic location of the Client and information of the Order for the Meal made by the Client (including the Restaurant where the Meal was ordered) and contact phone number of the Client.”_ This data is provided to the Courier as a separate data controller to be able to provide delivery services to our Clients as an independent delivery services provider. Pursuant to data processing agreement concluded between the Courier and Bolt, after providing the delivery service, the Courier is entitled to retain the Client data related to the performance of the delivery service for the maximum period of 1 month.

The data processing agreement between Bolt and the Courier and parties responsibilities in relation to data can be found here [(LISA 1)|https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/gED6sO71jwij0XUxFxrJ1/V4%20of%20Bolt-Courier%20T%26C%20(EST)%20-EST-.pdf]. Privacy Policy can be found [here|https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/5aYfdVhjTc904Anil6j5V6/Bolt%20Food%20Privacy%20Policy%20for%20courier%20and%20eaters%20(EST).pdf].

Courier (for the purpose of the Privacy Policy and T&C) means any *natural person, sole entrepreneur or legal entity* and where relevant, its employees and/or contractors, who have been registered in the Bolt Food Platform as a provider of the delivery service to the Client with respect to Goods ordered through the Bolt Food Platform.

It means, that we are entitled to share this data with the Fleet Owner that is the entity that provides services to Clients. As the Courier is the employee of the Fleets, Courier is entitled to access this data for services provision in the same way as the FO.

Other information about Data Recipients can be found in our Privacy Policy at [https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/5aYfdVhjTc904Anil6j5V6/Bolt Food Privacy Policy for courier and eaters (EST).pdf|https://static.food.bolt.eu/legalDocument/5aYfdVhjTc904Anil6j5V6/Bolt%20Food%20Privacy%20Policy%20for%20courier%20and%20eaters%20(EST).pdf] 

